#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:2 c08a14dbde924e7186ba5993394688ff
msgid "Agent Skills"
msgstr "智能体技能"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:4 7f046fb880c54de1aa8448101ca33501
msgid ""
"PyBroker ships `Agent Skills <https://agentskills.io/specification>`_ "
"that give coding agents workflows for writing strategies, indicators, "
"models, and backtests."
msgstr ""
"PyBroker 内置了 `智能体技能 "
"<https://agentskills.io/specification>`_，为编程智能体提供编写策略、指标、模型和回测的工作流程。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:9 555c19a13a8d4bbcb8ac3ef2df581685
