#: ../../../skills/pybroker-strategy-creator/SKILL.md:3
#: 2cf67835e9e9490e943498dacb7b8f5b
msgid ""
"Create practical PyBroker strategy code from user intent while preserving"
" backtest hygiene, including no lookahead leakage, explicit sizing, clear"
" risk controls, and locally valid PyBroker API usage."
