#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:158 1f1c1788ebc54e1ab736e583d5da3368
msgid "pybroker-indicator-creator"
msgstr "pybroker-indicator-creator"

#: ../../../skills/pybroker-indicator-creator/SKILL.md:3
#: 84156314fd7f4526b73a24698226f089
msgid ""
"Write fast, correct PyBroker indicators by registering vectorized "
"NumPy/Numba functions with `pybroker.indicator`, wiring them into "
"strategy executions and models, and keeping every value free of lookahead"
" bias. Covers the built-in indicator factories and vector helpers, custom"
" Numba `@njit` kernels, wrapping third-party technical analysis libraries"
" such as TA-Lib and pandas-ta, standalone computation with "
"`IndicatorSet`, hyperparam-driven indicators, and multi-timeframe "
"interval indicators."
msgstr ""
"编写快速、正确的 PyBroker 指标，方法是使用 `pybroker.indicator` 注册向量化的 NumPy/Numba "
"函数，将其接入策略执行函数和模型，并确保每个值都不含前视偏差。涵盖内置指标工厂和向量辅助函数、自定义 Numba `@njit` 内核、封装 "
"TA-Lib 和 pandas-ta 等第三方技术分析库、使用 `IndicatorSet` "
"进行独立计算、由超参数驱动的指标，以及多时间框架区间指标。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:165 13c340b4bdb44092acab3e9408daccfe
msgid ""
"`See full SKILL.md on GitHub "
"<https://github.com/edtechre/pybroker/blob/master/skills/pybroker-"
"indicator-creator/SKILL.md>`_"
msgstr ""
"`在 GitHub 上查看完整的 SKILL.md "
"<https://github.com/edtechre/pybroker/blob/master/skills/pybroker-"
"indicator-creator/SKILL.md>`_"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:171 ff9e2be11853423d99cf66c7edde6ec9
msgid "pybroker-model-trainer"
msgstr "pybroker-model-trainer"

#: ../../../skills/pybroker-model-trainer/SKILL.md:3
#: 92d95a4af0e64601a0af0cdd39d3d022
msgid ""
"Wire machine learning models into PyBroker backtests by registering "
"training and prediction functions with `pybroker.model`, feeding them "
"indicator features, and evaluating them with walkforward analysis while "
"keeping the train/test flow free of lookahead leakage. Covers per-symbol,"
" pooled multi-symbol, per-bar time-series, lagged-feature, and pretrained"
" models across common libraries such as scikit-learn, XGBoost, and arch."
msgstr ""
"将机器学习模型接入 PyBroker 回测，方法是使用 `pybroker.model` "
"注册训练和预测函数，为其提供指标特征，并通过向前分析对其进行评估，同时确保训练/测试流程不含前视泄漏。涵盖按品种独立训练、多品种联合训练、逐 K "
"线时间序列模型、滞后特征模型，以及基于 scikit-learn、XGBoost 和 arch 等常用库的预训练模型。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:178 3d69e80e3e8c46e18c27791c722cac7e
msgid ""
"`See full SKILL.md on GitHub "
